From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psx-place PS3 patch set (author not recorded) <>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:28:43 +0300
Subject: 0410_mmzone.patch

Origin: the psx-place PS3 patch set by Sombat Tragoongoson, a fix added after glevand's
 OtherOS++ set; the original author is not recorded. Taken from https://github.com/damiandudycz/ps3 (files/kernel-patches/psx-place-Sombat-Tragoongoson/6.12).

diff --git a/include/linux/mmzone.h b/include/linux/mmzone.h
--- a/include/linux/mmzone.h
+++ b/include/linux/mmzone.h
@@ -1774,7 +1774,7 @@ static inline bool movable_only_nodes(nodemask_t *nodes)
 #define SECTION_BLOCKFLAGS_BITS \
 	((1UL << (PFN_SECTION_SHIFT - pageblock_order)) * NR_PAGEBLOCK_BITS)
 
-#if (MAX_PAGE_ORDER + PAGE_SHIFT) > SECTION_SIZE_BITS
+#if (MAX_PAGE_ORDER - 1 + PAGE_SHIFT) > SECTION_SIZE_BITS
 #error Allocator MAX_PAGE_ORDER exceeds SECTION_SIZE
 #endif
 
